  "title": "Crispy Keto Fried Chicken in the Air Fryer",
  "description": "This quick, keto-friendly fried chicken cooked in an air fryer is breaded in pork rinds, kefir, and herbs and is so tasty you may not even realize it's not the real deal.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
